<title>RUSSIA: Russian wage arrears rise in February.</title>
<headline>Russian wage arrears rise in February.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from federal or regional governments rose to 10.33 trillion roubles in February from 9.48 trillion roubles in January, the State Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		Feb 24	Jan 27</p>
<p> wage arrears (government)	 10,334	 9,482</p>
<p> wage arrears (companies)	  39,902	39,120</p>
<p> wage arrears (total)		50,236	48,602</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
